    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1359_4721.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlich willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinnst</unclear>, sambt was wir
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eerenn</unclear> liebs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> guots vermögend, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, from,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig, ersam, wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear> guot fründt,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> lieb <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Eydtgnossen</orgName>. Demnach
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerer</unclear> burgeren wyland <persName resp="#ner">Sebastian <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhofer</unclear></persName>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">saeligen</unclear> erben handel und sachen (wie wir be-
<lb n="7"/>richtet sind) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beser</unclear> nit beschaffen, dann das
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leider</unclear>, von iren creditoren und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gläubigern</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>getrungen worden, all ir haab und guot, vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>als irer <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ordenlichen</unclear> oberkeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzuozeigen</unclear> und uf-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuolegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> nit verhanden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sijn</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>soll, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menigklichem</unclear> umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sijn</unclear> ansprach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernuegt</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdden</unclear> möge. So <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werddent</unclear> wir
<lb n="14"/>von unnserm lieben burger <persName resp="#ner">Hanßen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gruober</unclear></persName> zuo
<lb n="15"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-196" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lijon</unclear></placeName> wonhafft, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstendiget</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> die
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhoferischen</unclear> erben ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">drü</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thußent</unclear> ein
<lb n="17"/>und sibentzig sonnen cronen schuldig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sijne</unclear>, so er
<lb n="18"/>inen vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zechen</unclear> und mehr jaren an barem gelt
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgestrekt</unclear> und gelichen habe. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Darumbe</unclear> er
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">da</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dannen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wijl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jnig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alda</unclear> hinuß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ghandt</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>nit bezalt werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">könne</unclear>, mitt underthenig-
<lb n="22"/>em bitten, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welten</unclear> ime mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserm</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrijben</unclear> an üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beholffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sijn</unclear>, das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>bezalung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sijner</unclear> ansprach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jnen</unclear> kommen möge.
<lb n="25"/>Wann nun wir gesagtem <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gruober</unclear></persName> als unnserm lieben
<lb n="26"/>burger, inn dem und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderm</unclear> alle <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befüderuung</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoerzeigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> und willig, darnebent ouch
<lb n="28"/>berichtet sind, das inn diser sach von üch schon
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erkendt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermög</unclear> üwerer statuten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bij</unclear> üch also
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brüchig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sije</unclear>, das nach üweren burgeren, zum
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vordristen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eijdtgnossen</unclear>, bezalt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdden</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>und dieselben, anderen frömbden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußlendischen</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansprecheren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgaan</unclear> söllint. So
<lb n="34"/>ist hiemit unnser früntlich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eijdtgnößischs</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>bitten an üch, ir wöllint <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgenannten</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gruober</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sijner</unclear> ansprach halber inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstigem</unclear> bevelch
<lb n="37"/>haben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verschaffen</unclear>, das er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weniger</unclear> nit,
<lb n="38"/>dann ein anderer unnserer burgeren, einer (als
<lb n="39"/>der er ist) geachtet, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierjnnen</unclear> gehalten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdde</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1359_4722.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="40"/>wie wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalb</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwyflend</unclear>, und darby hoffend,
<lb n="41"/>ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdint</unclear> üch gegen gedachtem unserm burger,
<lb n="42"/>so günstig und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befüerdersam</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erwyßen</unclear>, das
<lb n="43"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spüeren</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voruß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rüemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khünn</unclear>, diser
<lb n="44"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüercklichen</unclear> genossen haben,
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölches</unclear> umb üch und die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear>, in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuotragenden</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fälen</unclear> widerumb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebeschulden</unclear>, und üch auch
<lb n="47"/>sonsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eydtgnössische</unclear> fründtschafft und liebe <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ze</unclear>-
<lb n="48"/>erzeigen, wellent wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzyt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotwillig</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>syn, datum <origDate when="1598" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">15</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">t</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Nouembris</unclear>, anno 98</origDate>.
<lb n="50"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath
<lb n="51"/>der Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Züerich</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1359_4723.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1359_4724.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="52"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, fürsichtigen, ehr-
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="54"/>und Rath der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> insonders guoten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>-
<lb n="56"/>en und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="57"/><orgName resp="#ner">Eydtgnossen</orgName>.
</p>
